From f4db0129f8f5bdf99e35850b2910cf7d27bef3b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Champagne <cjchampagne@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 13 May 2025 18:11:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-227736] pldm: add 12v pwr sensors and effecter

Add HL-338 specific sensors for the 12V domain.
    Effecter ID 387: Gaudi3 power effecter: Limit maximal
        supported power envelope for 12V domain (TDP)
    Sensor ID 388: Gaudi3 energy consumed by the 12V PSU
    Sensor ID 389: Gaudi3 Peak power consumption observed
        in 1 minute time window for 12V PSU

Change-Id: Ib6b4236a72d999b88783f88d17de4c516dd50293
Signed-off-by: Christopher Champagne <cjchampagne@habana.ai>
---

